    {
      "timestamp": "2026-08-30T22:25:45.618774+00:00",
      "type": "understanding",
      "summary": "Agent explained goal and mechanics.",
      "understanding": {
        "goal_understanding": "Navigate each level\u2019s grid to complete all goal cells. A goal cell can only be completed by stepping onto it while the carried piece\u2019s shape, color, and rotation exactly match that goal\u2019s required values; finishing all goals advances to the next level, and completing all levels wins.",
        "mechanics_understanding": "Each move (north/south/east/west) costs 1 stamina; when stamina hits 0, you lose 1 life and stamina resets to max, and losing all lives ends the game. Movement is blocked by walls; the state provides blocked_directions and you should never attempt those directions because you won\u2019t move and still spend stamina. Stepping on modifier tiles changes the carried piece: shape changers cycle shapes 0\u20135 (wrap), color changers cycle orange\u2192blue\u2192green\u2192red\u2192orange (wrap), and rotation changers rotate 90\u00b0 clockwise (0\u219290\u2192180\u2192270\u21920). A goal becomes activated only when shape+color+rotation all match simultaneously, and then stepping onto that goal completes it; stamina refill tiles restore stamina."
      }
    }
  ]
